  "prompt": "List every promotion's name and discount, deepest discount first. Return promo_name and discount_pct, in that order, with exactly these column names. Sort by discount_pct from highest to lowest, and where promotions share a discount, by promo_name from A to Z. One row per promotion, every promotion included. Rows with a missing discount_pct may come first or last, and so may rows with a missing promo_name among promotions that share a discount.",
